    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Create a program to find the factors of a number except the number."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The factors of a number n are all the numbers that perfectly divide n. For example,"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "text",
      "content": "Factors of 24: 1, 2, 3, 4, 6, 8, 12"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Note: We are excluding the number n."
    },
    {
      "type": "bullet_list",
      "items": [
        "Get input value for a variable named number.",
        "Run a for loop from i = 1  to i < number.",
        "In each iteration of the loop, check if number is perfectly divisible by i.",
        "If true, print the value of i."
      ]
    },
